OL,3,AChrista Pike in critical condition
OL,4,Aafter surviving two lethal injections,
OL,5,Alawyer says
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrison officials injected two lethal
OL,8,Fdoses of pentobarbital to Pike on
OL,9,FWednesday, but she survived and was
OL,10,Ftaken to hospital.
